error[E4101]: cannot borrow `value` as mutable more than once at a time
 --> tests/borrows/fail/E4101_scoped_task_alias.tarn:5:15
  |
4 |         spawn fn() { value = value + 1 }
  |               -------------------------- mutable borrow of `value` starts here
5 |         spawn fn() { value = value + 1 }
  |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ second mutable borrow here
